msgstr ""
"Configure independent parameters per account and task. Select account first,"
" then task, and the attribute controls will appear automatically. Only the "
"account name (phone) is needed, no password. Compatible with legacy "
"`account,password` format but passwords are not saved. Login also accepts "
"the last 4 digits of the phone number for matching (if unique)."

